# Linux native crypto libraries — release artifacts of qudo-jni-crypto, committed
# so CI builds are reproducible without pulling from external infrastructure.
# Source: scp'd once from /opt/zenv/qudo-pqc-developer-portal/docker/lib/ on the
# dev VPS. When qudo team cuts a new release, replace these files in-tree and
# bump the image tag. See README.md → "Updating native libraries".
# The Dockerfile's `patchelf --clear-execstack` step makes the build self-healing
# if a future drop ships with the executable-stack flag set.
# (Uncomment the line below to switch back to fetching them out-of-tree.)
# docker/native/*.so
